check 1
# Act I hire (q-chk-hirelings, REC-1515): hire from the Act 1 seller (npc 150) through the
# client's NPC flow, one C->S message per frame: 0x13 interact (world/npc.md §2),
# 0x2F chat open (§3), 0x36 hire (§7.3) of the first name of the seller's row
# (string id 3411; an offered=0 slot is accepted). Level-30 expansion Barbarian
# with 100000 gold (price vs. gold: vendors.md §9.1). Compares the hire result,
# the created hireling (hirelings.md §3, §4) and the 0x81/0x9E stat messages'
# state, then 60 frames of its follow AI. The player is poked next to the seller
# (poke goto unit 1:150).
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name hire-kashya-cs
save ScnHi1 --class bar --expansion --level 30 --gold 100000
seed 1234
ticks 90
seconds 400
channels cstate
at 4 poke goto unit 1:150
at 8 send InteractWithEntity type=1 id=@1:150
at 10 send InitEntityChat id=@1:150
at 14 send HireMerc npc=@1:150 merc=3411
